WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
D1 belongs to System A. Business services A and B depend on that system, so review both services.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
D5 belongs to System C, which supports Mission services A and B. Mission service A also depends on System B.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The link joins D7 in System A and D3 in System B. Review Business services A and B and Mission service A, and check alternative paths.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Confirm the recorded dependencies, alternative paths and current service state before concluding that a service is affected.
